<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $.50</p>
<p>lower. Trade moderate. Top $59.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.00-59.25</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     58.00-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows: 300-500 lbs steady; 500-700 lbs. steady to 1.00 lower. Top 56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs	49.00</p>
<p>	   400-450 lbs	50.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	53.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	53.50-54.00</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs	55.00-55.50</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs	56.00</p>
</text>
